#: ../../source/core-js_README.md:132
msgid ""
"`modules` path is internal API, does not inject all required dependencies"
" and can be changed in minor or patch releases. Use it only for a custom "
"build and / or if you know what are you doing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/core-js_README.md:133
msgid ""
"`core-js` is extremely modular and uses a lot of very tiny modules, "
"because of that for usage in browsers bundle up `core-js` instead of "
"usage loader for each file, otherwise, you will have hundreds of "
"requests."
msgstr ""

