"js/blob/v2.6.12/modules/es6.object.freeze.js), "
"[`es6.object.seal`](https://github.com/zloirock/core-"
"js/blob/v2.6.12/modules/es6.object.seal.js), [`es6.object.prevent-"
"extensions`](https://github.com/zloirock/core-"
"js/blob/v2.6.12/modules/es6.object.prevent-extensions.js), [`es6.object"
